 <h3><u>Manam safeer-e-aza</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Manam safeer-e-aza</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Bar Muhammad wa aal-e-Muhammad salawaat</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Allahuma salle ala Muhammadin wa aal-e-Muhammad</p> <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 Manam safeer-e-Karbala</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Zamee(n) pe hamko bhejkar (Nabi se rabne kehdiya) x2</li>
    <p>Yahi to hai wo kaam jo karengi zikr-e-karbala</p>
    <p>Qabila inka eik hai, Wasila inka eik hai</p>
    <p>Hussain ke hai matami jo kehrahe hai par mala</p>
    <p>Maa(n) ki godi mei suni mene ye nawho(n) ki azaan</p>
    <p>Gutniyo(n) chalne jo paaya to mila farsh-e-aza</p>
    <p>Sheer-e-madar se mere khun mei ye baat basi</p>
    <p>Jab talak saans rahe, jaari rahe lab pe sada</p>
    <p>Manam safeer-e-aza</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <li>Labo(n) pe hai yahi sada, (mujhe hai fakhr bakhuda) x2</li>
    <p>Sabab mere wujood ka bani dua-e-Sayyeda</p>
    <p>To kyu(n) na jaawu(n) har jaga, Bara-e-majlis-e-aza</p>
    <p>Sikaarte aza ka kaam Sayyeda ne de diya</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <li>Suno(n) mere Hussayniyo, (meri sada mei saath do) x2</li>
    <p>Nadeem-e-shaah-e-Karbala jo mei bhi hu(n) jo tum bhi ho</p>
    <p>Kaho ye baat har jaga, Saja ke lab pe karbala</p>
    <p>Tumhaare khu(n) ki eik eik bund se uthe sada</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <li>Gineez book hai cheez kya (falak pe likha jaayenga) x2</li>
    <p>Tumhaara naam aur iska saath safeer-e-aza</p>
    <p>Magar bas eik shart hai, Zabaa(n) tumhaari jab khule</p>
    <p>Sunaao(n) maqsad-e-Hussain bas ye kehke har jaga</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <li>Jo hai yazeed ke pisar (zabaa(n) kaat de agar) x2</li>
    <p>Lahu se ik sada uthe, kare hawaao(n) mei safar</p>
    <p>yazeed ke sipaahiyo(n), suno meri sada suno</p>
    <p>Tumhare bas ki baat hi nahi ke mujhko do qaza</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <li>Hamari dars gaah ka (pata hai sirf karbala) x2</li>
    <p>Hamara dil pe hukmaraan hai pisaar Batool ka</p>
    <p>Jahaa(n) bhi ham rakhe qadam, rahenga dosh par alam</p>
    <p>Alam utha ke bawafa ka ham kahenge har jaga</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <li>Sikhaaya waalidayn ne (lahu pe tere qarz hai) x2</li>
    <p>Ye zikr-e-Shaah-e-karbala labo(n) pe har ghari rahe</p>
    <p>Charaagh-e-haq jaalaye jaa, Zamane ko bataaye jaa</p>
    <p>Mei zakir-e-Hussain hu(n), Hasab nasab hai ye mera</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <li>Meyaan-e-dasht-e-karbala (har ik shaheed-e-basafa) x2</li>
    <p>Badan pe teer khaa ke de raha tha bas yahi sada</p>
    <p>Shaheed-e-tashnakaam hu(n), Hussain ka ghulaam hu(n)</p>
    <p>Meri hayaat ka do aam, hai yahi laqab mera</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <li>Wo bint-e-Shaah-e-La Fatah (Huwi jo qayd se riha) x2</li>
    <p>To usne qayd-e-zulm mei manaaya gham Hussain ka</p>
    <p>Wo pehli majlis-e-aza, Bapa huwi to ye kaha</p>
    <p>Hussain tu gawaah hai, bani hu(n) baad-e-karbala</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p>
    <li>Sada hai ye Irfan ki (suno to Mazhar Abidi) x2</li>
   </ol> <p>Gham-e-Hussain ke liye hai waqf meri zindagi</p> <p>Jahaa(n) talaq mere khuda, Karengi zindagi wafa</p> <p>Mere badan se ruh se lahu se aayengi sada</p> <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p> <p>(Manam safeer-e-aza) x2 (Manam safeer-e-Karbala) x2</p></font>
